OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson sentenced to 15 years in
OL,5,Aprison for child sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former leader of the Democratic
OL,8,FUnionist Party, Jeffrey Donaldson, has
OL,9,Fbeen sentenced to 15 years in prison
OL,10,Ffor a series of child sex offences,
OL,11,Fincluding rape
OL,13,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,14,Foffences, which he committed against
OL,15,Ftwo women when they were children,
OL,16,Fbetween 1985 and 2008
OL,18,FReading statements from the victims,
OL,19,Fthe sentencing judge says one woman
OL,20,Fgrew up feeling ashamed, while the
OL,21,Fother says: "Every day I pray God will
OL,22,Flet me die"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
