OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson sentenced to 15 years in
OL,5,Aprison for child sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge says the ex-MP's offences
OL,8,Fhave led to a "catastrophic descent
OL,9,Finto disgrace", and he had not offered
OL,10,F"one word of regret, apology or shame".
OL,11,FDonaldson was stripped of his
OL,12,Fknighthood in July
OL,14,FThe DUP - which Donaldson led from 2021
OL,15,Fto 2024 - says: "He deserves every day
OL,16,Fof the lengthy prison sentence"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
